Define the camera composition rules:
- eye height 1.6–1.7 m;
- pitch −5° to +5°;
- UE default 90° horizontal FOV;
- sun elevation about 25–35°, side- or back-lit;
- sky_fraction within g–j's 0.014–0.075. All Godot prototype frames, at about 0.076–0.090, sit slightly above it.

State these in `harness/cams_ue58.json`.

Make the first M1 step: run test_geo.py, test_measured_rebuild.py, audit_measured_axes.py and a comparison of the provider DEM against the reconstruction.

