- a CharacterBody3D controller;
- HeightMapShape3D colliders built from the 1 m terrain per tile;
- capsule colliders for trunks within about 50 m, generated from the stem list;
- simplified convex shapes for hero rocks.

Add to acceptance: 'a scripted walk over lava relief completes without falling through or snagging', and include physics time in the bench JSON.

